This module has no dependencies outside the Go standard library and the
go-fast modules. It does contain tables generated from data published by
others. The tables are in internal/charset (files ending in _gen.go),
made by internal/charset/gen/gen.go, and internal/font/cjk.bin,
cffstrings_gen.go and macnames_gen.go, made by internal/font/gen/gen.go;
each generator names its sources. The notices
those sources ask to be kept follow.

The encodings that the PDF specification defines (StandardEncoding,
WinAnsiEncoding, MacRomanEncoding, MacExpertEncoding and
PDFDocEncoding) are read from the specification itself, ISO 32000-1:2008
Annex D and Table 115: which code stands for which character. No other
part of the specification is in this module.

