3. CMaps for Chinese, Japanese and Korean

Source: https://github.com/adobe-type-tools/cmap-resources (the CMaps of
Adobe-CNS1-7, Adobe-GB1-6, Adobe-Japan1-7 and Adobe-Korea1-2) and
https://github.com/adobe-type-tools/mapping-resources-pdf (pdf2unicode:
Adobe-CNS1-UCS2, Adobe-GB1-UCS2, Adobe-Japan1-UCS2, Adobe-Korea1-UCS2,
Adobe-KR-UCS2).
Used for: internal/font/cjk.bin (the predefined CMaps of the PDF
specification, and the maps from the CIDs of each collection to
Unicode).

Modification notice: the CMaps are kept without their comments and
blank lines, each compressed with DEFLATE.

