5. Standard Macintosh glyph order

Source: Lib/fontTools/ttLib/standardGlyphOrder.py of fontTools,
https://github.com/fonttools/fonttools
Used for: internal/font/macnames_gen.go (the 258 glyph names a TrueType
'post' table refers to by number).

